%N A135865 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = 1 + x*A(4*x)^(1/2).
%H A135865 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A135865/b135865.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..58</a>
%F A135865 a(0) = a(1) = 1; a(n) = (1/2) * (4^(n-1)*a(n-1) - Sum_{k=2..n-1} a(k) * a(n+1-k)). - _Seiichi Manyama_, Sep 25 2026
%o A135865 (PARI) {a(n)=local(A=1+x+x*O(x^n));for(i=0,n,A=1+x*subst(A,x,4*x)^(1/2));polcoeff(A,n)}
